1
00:00:00,258 --> 00:00:01,938
Kumain ka na raw ba?

2
00:00:02,508 --> 00:00:05,468
Ano, Pa?

3
00:00:06,005 --> 00:00:10,445
'Yun ang tanong ni Mama. Bago kami umalis papuntang ospital.

4
00:00:10,993 --> 00:00:13,473
Nasa trabaho ako noon.

5
00:00:14,053 --> 00:00:15,293
Alam niya.

6
00:00:15,842 --> 00:00:19,122
Sabi ko, mamaya na kayo mag-usap.

7
00:00:20,022 --> 00:00:23,322
Akala ko, may mamaya pa.

8
00:00:24,342 --> 00:00:26,902
Pa... sorry.

9
00:00:27,555 --> 00:00:30,955
Kumain ka muna, anak. Dito lang ako.

10
00:00:36,727 --> 00:00:40,407
Pa, maghahanap na ako ng flight.
